          {
            "title": "Question: Square brackets",
            "id": 79838,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dove vanno le parentesi <code>[ ]</code> in una lista?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Intorno a tutti i valori nell'elenco</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Prima dei valori nell'elenco</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Intorno a ogni valore nell'elenco</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Intorno a tutti i valori nell'elenco.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ti serve una sola lista contenente <code>\"Lima\"</code> e <code>\"Oslo\"</code>. Quale assegnazione ha le parentesi nella posizione corretta?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>cities = [\"Lima\", \"Oslo\"]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>cities = [\"Lima\"], [\"Oslo\"]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>cities = [\"Lima\", \"Oslo\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>cities = [\"Lima\", \"Oslo\"]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Any number",
            "id": 79796,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quanti valori contiene questo elenco?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cats = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;whiskers&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(cats)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['whiskers', 'tom']\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Due</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Uno</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Zero</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere Due.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa memorizza l'assegnazione in <code>cats</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cats = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;whiskers&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(cats)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['whiskers', 'tom']\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Una lista contenente due valori stringa</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Una lista contenente un'unica stringa combinata</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Una lista vuota perché le stringhe sono tra virgolette</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Una lista contenente due valori stringa.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Square brackets",
            "id": 79834,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea una lista che memorizzi <code>\"classic\"</code> e <code>\"dark mode\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"themes = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;classic&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dark mode&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(themes)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['classic', 'dark mode']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>[</code>, seguito da <code>,</code> e infine <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea una lista che memorizzi <code>\"classic\"</code> e <code>\"dark mode\"</code>, in modo che stampi <code>['classic', 'dark mode']</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"themes = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;classic&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dark mode&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(themes)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"+\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['classic', 'dark mode']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>[</code>, seguito da <code>,</code> e infine <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Empty list",
            "id": 80451,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usa le parentesi <code>[ ]</code> per assegnare una lista vuota a <code>plans</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"plans = []\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(plans)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"10\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>[]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Multiple values",
            "id": 80452,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usa una virgola per memorizzare un'altra stringa nell'elenco.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"players = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Federer&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Murray&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Players for the match:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(players)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"50\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Players for the match:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"['Federer', 'Murray']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>,</code>, seguito da <code>\"Murray\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Memorizza il secondo giocatore, <code>\"Murray\"</code>, nella lista in modo che stampi <code>['Federer', 'Murray']</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"players = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Federer&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Murray&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Players for the match:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(players)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"50\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"+\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Players for the match:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"['Federer', 'Murray']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>,</code>, seguito da <code>\"Murray\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Index",
            "id": 79479,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cosa sono gli indici?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Posizioni numerate degli elementi negli elenchi</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Valori degli elementi nelle liste</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Elementi negli elenchi</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Posizioni numerate degli elementi negli elenchi.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gli indici sono le posizioni numerate degli elementi di una lista.</p><p>Una lista di punteggi contiene <code>[90, 85, 78]</code>. Che cos'è <code>85</code> in quella lista?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Un valore memorizzato in corrispondenza di un indice</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">L'indice stesso</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Il numero di elementi della lista</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Un valore memorizzato in corrispondenza di un indice.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Access element",
            "id": 79516,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Accedi alla variabile <code>third</code> nell'elenco tramite il suo indice, <code>2</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"first = \" /><text value=\"&quot;John&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"second = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Joseph&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"third = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Donnie&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"winners = [first, second, third]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(winners[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"99\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Donnie\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Access element",
            "id": 79467,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come si accede al primo elemento di questa lista?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"test_scores = [\" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"85\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>test_scores[0]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>test_scores[1]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>test_scores[90]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>test_scores[0]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dopo aver eseguito <code>test_scores.pop(0)</code>, quale espressione recupera <code>85</code> dalla lista?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"test_scores = [\" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"85\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">test_scores[0]</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">test_scores[1]</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">test_scores[85]</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere test_scores[0].</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Valid index",
            "id": 79569,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usa l'indice <code>2</code> per aggiornare l'ultimo gusto di gelato a <code>\"strawberry\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"flavors = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;chocolate&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;pistachio&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"flavors[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"&quot;strawberry&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(flavors)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"57\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['vanilla', 'chocolate', 'strawberry']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Valid index",
            "id": 79514,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è l'ultimo indice a cui possiamo accedere in questo elenco?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"color_scheme = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;lightBlue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;orange&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;gray&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>4</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale espressione recupera <code>\"gray\"</code> da questa lista?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"color_scheme = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;lightBlue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;orange&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;gray&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>color_scheme[2]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>color_scheme[3]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>color_scheme[\"gray\"]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>color_scheme[2]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: End of the list",
            "id": 79605,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi <code>3</code> alla fine dell'elenco scrivendo <code>.append(3)</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"trading_values = [\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"trading_values.append(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(trading_values)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"48\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[1, 2, 3]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>.append(3)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Pop",
            "id": 79601,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa fa <code>.pop()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Rimuove l'ultimo valore da un elenco</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Aggiunge un valore a un elenco</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Rimuove un valore casuale da una lista</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Rimuove l'ultimo valore da un elenco.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La lista inizia come <code>colors = [\"red\", \"blue\"]</code>. Che cosa contiene <code>colors</code> dopo <code>colors.pop()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[\"red\"]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[\"blue\"]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[\"red\", \"blue\"]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>[\"red\"]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: insert",
            "id": 79604,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi <code>\"windy\"</code> all'inizio di questo elenco con <code>insert()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"forecast = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;sunny&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;cloudy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"forecast.insert(\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"&quot;windy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(forecast)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['windy', 'sunny', 'cloudy']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>insert</code>, seguito da <code>0</code> e poi <code>,</code>, <code>\"windy\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi <code>\"windy\"</code> all'inizio in modo che la lista stampi <code>['windy', 'sunny', 'cloudy']</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"forecast = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;sunny&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;cloudy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"forecast.insert(\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"&quot;windy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(forecast)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"append\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;sunny&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['windy', 'sunny', 'cloudy']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>insert</code>, seguito da <code>0</code>, <code>,</code> e infine <code>\"windy\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Pop",
            "id": 79619,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Rimuovi l'ultimo valore dall'elenco <code>quiz_answers</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"quiz_answers = [\" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"quiz_answers.pop()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(quiz_answers)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"append()\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"insert()\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[False, False, True]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>pop()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Rimuovi l'ultimo valore dalla lista <code>quiz_answers</code>, in modo che stampi <code>[False, False, True]</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"quiz_answers = [\" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"quiz_answers.pop()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(quiz_answers)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"append()\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"insert()\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pop(0)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[False, False, True]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>pop()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
